<title>NETHERLANDS: Heidemij Q1 net profit NLG 15.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Heidemij Q1 net profit NLG 15.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.83 vs   0.22</p>
<p>    Net profit			    15.6  vs   4.1</p>
<p>    Revenues			     235.8  vs 217.1</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     8.4  vs   7.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Engineering consultancy firm Heidemij NV is listed on the Amsterdam stock exchange and on Nasdaq in the U.S.  </p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.9  vs   0.5</p>
<p>    Tax					2.9  vs   3.0</p>
<p>    Non-consolidated companies	 0.1  vs   0.1 charge</p>
<p>    Minority interests		   NIL  vs   0.1</p>
<p>    Extraordinary income after tax   11.1 vs   NIL</p>
<p>NOTES - Heidemij said it had made a book profit of 11.1 million guilders on the sale of its 5.6 percent stake in engineering consultancy Fugro.</p>
<p>Heidemij NV said the number of shares was 18.865 million compared with 18.646 million in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
